<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    :root { --text: #1d1d1f; --muted: #6e6e73; --card: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.09); --accent: #0f9d6a; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root { --text: #f5f5f7; --muted: #a1a1a6; --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); --accent: #34d399; }
    }
    body { font: 12.5px/1.45 -apple-system, "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; color: var(--text); margin: 0 2px; }
    h1 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 2px 0 2px; }
    h1 .ver { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
    .lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .box { padding: 7px 10px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; }
    .ltr { direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; }
    code { font: 11px "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; }
    b { font-weight: 600; }
    ul.f { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; }
    ul.f li { margin: 0 0 6px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>@PLUGIN_DISPLAY_NAME@ <span class="ver">@CMAKE_PROJECT_VERSION@</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Studio-grade green and blue screen keying for OBS Studio.</p>
  <ul class="f">
    <li><b>Natural hair edges</b> &mdash; fine strands stay soft, never blocky or checkered.</li>
    <li><b>AI person protection</b> &mdash; Apple Vision protects the presenter and green or blue clothing, entirely on this Mac.</li>
    <li><b>Clean color, stable motion</b> &mdash; edge decontamination, despill and motion-aware denoise.</li>
    <li><b>Native everywhere</b> &mdash; universal for Apple silicon and Intel, GPU accelerated.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="box">Quit OBS Studio before continuing. The plugin is installed for your account only; no administrator password is needed.</p>
</body>
</html>
